  (text "J30 mates with the other board. Pins 1-8 are pack power, 9-16 and 20 are ground, 17-18 are hat 3.3 V, 19 is the latch, 21-22 are I2C1 after the series resistors, 23-24 are +5V_PI. The paralleled pack pins must be rated 15 A together."
    (at 25.4 25.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid 1a022ed3-b597-41ef-b8de-e7dfc84d3536)
